			"color":"#432",
			"widgets_values":[
				"在灯火阑珊、充满古风韵味的木质村落街头，三位身着优雅轻盈古装的少女——仙灵林、仙灵梅与仙灵悦，正共同开启一场梦幻的夜晚盛宴。镜头起始于仙灵林的近景，她怀抱毛绒小马，眼神中透着调皮与期待。随着她惊喜地捂嘴、灿烂地笑开，并充满激情地向观众宣布“今晚准备了精彩节目”，气氛瞬间被点燃。紧接着，三位少女在绚丽的烟花映衬下，展开了一场如梦似幻的丝绸舞。她们身姿曼妙，宽大的袖袍随动作如羽翼般翻飞，在暖色灯笼与彩色烟火的交织光影中，舞动出极致的视觉美感。整段视频从亲切的互动平滑过渡到华丽的舞蹈表演，展现了古风浪漫与欢庆氛围的完美融合。\n\n0-2秒：The camera holds a medium close-up on Fairy Lin, a young woman in flowing white and pale green ancient robes, her eyes wide with playful anticipation. She holds a small, plush horse toy close to her chest, her fingers gently clutching its soft mane. Beside her, Fairy Mei, also in elegant robes, smiles radiantly, holding her own plush horse. The warm, golden light from nearby lanterns illuminates their faces against the dim, atmospheric backdrop of a traditional wooden village street. Fairy Lin leans forward slightly, her expression mischievous as she looks toward the camera, her lips parted as if about to speak.\n|\n2-4秒：Fairy Lin's face transforms, her playful grin turning into a determined, slightly focused look. She begins to speak, her lips moving clearly as she addresses the viewer: \"Tonight, we have prepared a wonderful program for you!\" Her eyes are bright and engaging, pulling the audience into her excitement. Fairy Mei nods encouragingly beside her, her smile steady and supportive. The camera remains steady, capturing the clarity of Fairy Lin's enthusiastic announcement against the cozy, lantern-lit night.\n|\n4-6秒：Suddenly, the atmosphere shifts as Fairy Lin's expression becomes one of intense, focused energy. She begins a graceful, sweeping movement, her long white sleeves billowing outward like wings. Her body rotates with fluid precision, her feet stepping lightly on the stone pavement. Fairy Mei and the third girl, Fairy Yue, stand to her sides, their expressions turning serious and focused as they prepare for the dance. The background lanterns flicker slightly, adding to the dynamic energy of the scene.\n",
				6,
				true,
				false,
				"customize",
				false,
				1070358272,
				"randomize"
			],
